    "n": 38,
    "widest_px": 753.7,
    "texts": [
     "Claude just made it",
     "easier to run their",
     "managed AI agents with",
     "these four new features.",
     "Number one,",
     "each managed agent can",
     "now have its own session",
     "budget, meaning no more",
     "overspending in things",
     "that you don't need.",
     "Number two,",
     "each session can get their",
     "own advisor, meaning",
     "a bigger,",
     "more intelligent",
     "model that is",
     "going to help them",
     "while they're working.",
     "Number three,",
     "they can now",
     "load their skills",
     "from any repository that",
     "you connect them to.",
     "And number four, now",
     "you can choose where",
     "the inference is running,",
     "meaning that you can",
     "choose where your",
     "AI agent is going to",
     "be working from,",
     "whether it's the US",
     "or Europe.",
     "Now, follow for more",
     "AI news, videos, and",
     "tutorials each and",
     "every single day,",
     "and catch you",
     "in the next one."
    ],
    "min_aspect": 2.62
